NOTICE

This repository quotes verbatim excerpts from Anthropic's public documentation
and from public talks by Anthropic employees. The largest concentration is the
prompt snippet library in skill/*/references/snippets.md: 24 verbatim snippets,
32 quoted blocks, roughly 2,100 words, drawn from three documentation pages.
The rest of the skill quotes roughly 530 further words, and each study guide in
docs/ quotes roughly 500 more as individual attributed sentences -- so on the
order of 3,600 words in total, before counting the Chinese edition, whose
English blocks are byte-identical to the English edition's rather than
additional.

Those excerpts are the property of Anthropic. Each is attributed at the point of
use -- the snippet index links every quoted entry to its source page -- and in
SOURCES.md, and they are included for the purpose of documenting technique.

The MIT grant above covers this repository's own prose, structure, and tooling.
It does NOT cover the quoted material, and does not purport to grant anyone
rights to it.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anthropic.
"Claude" and "Anthropic" are trademarks of Anthropic PBC and are used here only
descriptively, to identify the systems this material documents.
